---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE, waLink } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="About SUP Stocklot Direct — Honest Liquidation Supply"
  path="/about/"
  description="Who we are: a Qingdao-based stocklot specialist moving cancelled-order and surplus inflatable SUP inventory to verified B2B buyers. Honest grading, no fake scarcity, no brand warranty theater."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About"
    title="Honest Liquidation Supply, No Theater"
    subtitle="We move real overstock — cancelled orders, surplus runs, cosmetic seconds — from Qingdao warehouses to verified business buyers. No fake countdowns, no inflated reference prices, no 'was $899' games. Real lots, real quantities, real terms."
  />

  <section class="border-b border-slate-800/80">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">What we do</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Factories and brands in the paddle-board industry regularly end up with finished goods nobody contracted
            to take: cancelled OEM orders, surplus production, quality-control cosmetic seconds. That inventory ties
            up warehouse space and cash. Our job is to move it — fast, honestly, and in wholesale quantities — to
            importers, distributors, rental operators and schools who can use it profitably.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            We buy distressed lots, pressure-test every board to a written protocol, publish accurate manifests, and
            sell AS-IS at liquidation prices. We are a trading operation, not a charity and not a factory: our margin
            is in the spread and the speed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">What we are deliberately not</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li><strong class="text-slate-100">Not a brand.</strong> The stock is de-branded. No original-brand warranty, guarantee cards or after-sales service comes with it — and we do not pretend otherwise.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-slate-100">Not a consumer shop.</strong> B2B only, with a minimum order of {SITE.moqPolicy}. If you want one board for the weekend, we are the wrong site.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-slate-100">Not a forever-supply line.</strong> A stocklot is by definition finite. When it sells out, it is gone. We will tell you what is available today, never promise a restock.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">Why buyers trust the process</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Every board passes a <strong class="text-slate-100">72-hour inflated pressure test</strong> ({SITE.qcProtocol.pressure}, pressure drop {SITE.qcProtocol.maxDrop}) before dispatch.</li>
            <li>Third-party inspection (SGS, BV, TÜV) is welcome <em>before</em> you pay the balance — we do not ask you to trust us, we ask you to verify.</li>
            <li>Manifests list exact quantities, carton dimensions, gross and net weights per lot.</li>
            <li>Tiered pricing is published on every lot page — no "contact us for pricing" hiding.</li>
            <li>Verified buyers get portal access to the branded material (original photos, packing lists, barcode ranges) we deliberately keep off the public site.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">Where we operate</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Goods are warehoused in Qingdao, China. {SITE.portFull}. We ship worldwide — the US, EU, UK, Canada,
            Australia and New Zealand are our regular lanes, and we quote freight per destination. Note that import
            compliance (GPSR in the EU, CPSC duties in the US, and equivalents elsewhere) is the importer's
            responsibility; our <a class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200" href="/shipping/">shipping &amp; compliance notes</a> tell you what to check.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50">Talk to a human</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            The fastest channel is WhatsApp ({SITE.whatsappDisplay}) — messages reach the sales desk directly, and
            quotes go out within one business day.
          </p>
          <a href={waLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#25D366] px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-[#1ebe5b]">WhatsApp the sales desk</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
